      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "IVORY QUILL (8) latest effort finished 4th on October 15 over 390m at this track behind Kiowa Icon beaten 6 lengths (22.50) in a Rank Limit - Grade 5. Rates on top and should go close. BEAR IT IS (4) finds it hard to break through. Continues to race well, filling the minors at the last three starts, the latest when third (22.67) at this track. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from four attempts. Overdue and gets his chance. DEB CABANG (1) is a handy dog who jumped from box 3 last time out and scored by 1.2 lengths at this track (22.55). Looks a key chance if runs up to latest figure. ARIZONA ICON (7) gets a chance to redeem an unplaced effort here last start.",
